//! SOURCE-root entry for the multi-process SQLite scenarios.
//!
//! Usage: protos <provider and library grants> --allow-entropy --allow-clock \
//!   src/sqlite-process-main.protos <scenario> <database> [arguments...]
//! Driven by src/tests/test-sqlite-processes.sh. The scenarios themselves are
//! in src/tests/sqlite-process.protos; this entry only forwards its explicit
//! process, Entropy and Clock authority to them.

import("./tests/sqlite-process.protos").run(process.args(), process, entropy, clock)
